            <div xml:id="d724">

                <pb facs="0779" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1178</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-06T16:00:00+01:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">November 6, 1914, 4 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 6 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Considerable feeling here because British closing North Sea. Swedish Government
                    issued protest.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Minister</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
